# Copy to .env on each machine and set the registry's LAN address.
#
# Use the LAN ADDRESS of the machine serving the registry, never localhost:
# the host is part of the image name, so `localhost:5001/x` and
# `192.168.1.10:5001/x` are different references. Pushing to localhost and
# pulling from the LAN IP looks like "the image is not in the registry".
#
#   Mac (serves the registry):  REGISTRY=192.168.15.29:5001
#   Windows (pulls):            REGISTRY=192.168.15.29:5001   # same value
#
# TAG defaults to the git commit; override to pin a build.
# REGISTRY=192.168.15.29:5001
# TAG=8ac30c3
